            "review_text": "Daniela D\n21 contributions\n0\nHidden gem, delicious and great service.\nOct 2024 • Family\nHidden gem right here. They have a great selection of delicious food (seafood on a pan is amazing 🤤), service is fantastic and with a smile, intimate, and good location with a beach view. Have eaten here a few times, even brought friends while we were staying in Nha Trang. Thanks for great meals. \n(Photo of seafood on a pan taken from their Facebook page because I ate it so quick and forgot to take a photo)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 19, 2024",
